From 4e128444c7742073de8910b58dd074e48bd7de09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xieguaiwu <xieguaiwu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 13:00:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Picture Trans (com.xieguiawu.picturetrans)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

LAN file transfer between an Android phone and a computer browser — no
USB, no cloud, no PC-side install.

- MIT licensed, pure FOSS dependencies (Ktor/Compose/zxing)
- No AntiFeatures: no proprietary network service, no tracking
- Single-purpose permissions; scoped storage on API 29+
- Reproducible build verified locally (dual-build SHA-256 match at v1.0.0)
- Fastlane metadata (en-US / zh-CN), Robolectric-rendered UI screenshots
- Category File Transfer (validated against config/categories.yml)
---
 metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml

diff --git a/metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml b/metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4ee791b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# F-Droid 收录 metadata
+# 提交位置：gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata → metadata/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml
+# 流程：fork fdroiddata → 新建该文件 → MR（GitLab CI 自动 lint + build 验证）
+# 校验：bash scripts/validate-fdroid-metadata.sh docs/fdroid/com.xieguiawu.picturetrans.yml
+# 说明：无 AntiFeatures —— 纯局域网工具，不依赖任何专有网络服务，无追踪。
+#       注意明文 HTTP：这是局域网内有意取舍，已在 full_description 声明并警告
+#       不得暴露公网；F-Droid 不因明文 HTTP 拒绝收录（仅影响传输机密性）。
+# 注意：Builds 只列已打 tag 的版本。
+
+Categories:
+  - File Transfer
+License: MIT
+AuthorName: xieguaiwu
+AuthorEmail: xieguaiwu@users.noreply.github.com
+SourceCode: https://github.com/xieguaiwu/picture-trans
+IssueTracker: https://github.com/xieguaiwu/picture-trans/issues
+Changelog: https://github.com/xieguaiwu/picture-trans/releases
+
+AutoName: Picture Trans
+
+RepoType: git
+Repo: https://github.com/xieguaiwu/picture-trans
+
+Builds:
+  - versionName: 1.0.0
+    versionCode: 1
+    commit: v1.0.0
+    subdir: app
+    gradle:
+      - yes
+
+AutoUpdateMode: Version
+UpdateCheckMode: Tags
+CurrentVersion: 1.0.0
+CurrentVersionCode: 1
